  "notes": "{近|ちか}づける means to bring something or someone closer.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{近|ちか}づく→近づく：01958_chikazuku⟧ (intransitive, to approach)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{近|ちか}づける: to bring one's face closer\n- ⟦{耳|みみ}→耳：01513_mimi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{近|ちか}づける: to bring one's ear closer (to listen)\n- ⟦{火|ひ}→火：02248_hi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{近|ちか}づけない: not bring fire near\n- ⟦{距離|きょり}→距離：05331_kyori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{近|ちか}づける: to close the distance\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{近|ちか}づけている indicates ongoing action of bringing closer.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{近|ちか}づく→近づく：01958_chikazuku⟧: to approach (intransitive)\n- ⟦{近|ちか}い→近い：00530_chikai⟧: close, near (adjective)\n- ⟦{離|はな}す→離す：19372_hanasu⟧: to separate (opposite action)",
